HAI 1.2
CAN HAS STDIO?
BTW ============================================================================
BTW GUDGEON MARITIME AUTONOMY :: DISCRETE KALMAN FILTER STATE ESTIMATOR
BTW Recursive minimum mean-square error state estimation
BTW ============================================================================

I HAS A STATE_X ITZ 0.0
I HAS A COVARIANCE_P ITZ 1.0

HOW IZ I KALMAN_CYCLE YR Z_MEAS
    I HAS A INNO ITZ DIFF OF Z_MEAS AN STATE_X
    I HAS A K ITZ QUOSHUNT OF COVARIANCE_P AN SUM OF COVARIANCE_P AN 0.2
    STATE_X R SUM OF STATE_X AN PRODUKT OF K AN INNO
    FOUND YR STATE_X
IF U SAY SO

